    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cozy Gardener Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3831060,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cozy Gardener Simulator, you\u2019re more than just a gardener - you're the heart of a peaceful little town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your cozy, no-stress escape - a world where time moves gently and small acts of care make all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Own Paradise</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small plot and develop it into a thriving garden. Plant vegetables, grow flowers, and restore neglected areas. Each action improves your garden and benefits the surrounding neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Care for Your Town &amp; Its People</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist your neighbors with tasks, maintain public spaces, and improve the town\u2019s appearance. Building relationships and completing requests unlocks new opportunities and community progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new tools, unlock unique seeds, and discover delightful decorations to personalize your garden. As you expand your gardening skills, new opportunities open up - from secret garden spots to charming new areas to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf38 A Gentle World, One Task at a Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no deadlines here. No stress. Just calm, heartfelt gameplay that lets you take life one task - and one bloom - at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're planting sunflowers, mowing a neighbor\u2019s lawn, or sweeping leaves off a path, everything you do brings a little more joy to this cozy little world.<br><br>\ud83c\udf3c Cozy Gardener Simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful life. A growing heart. Welcome home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cozy Gardener Simulator, you\u2019re more than just a gardener - you're the heart of a peaceful little town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your cozy, no-stress escape - a world where time moves gently and small acts of care make all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Own Paradise</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small plot and develop it into a thriving garden. Plant vegetables, grow flowers, and restore neglected areas. Each action improves your garden and benefits the surrounding neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Care for Your Town &amp; Its People</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist your neighbors with tasks, maintain public spaces, and improve the town\u2019s appearance. Building relationships and completing requests unlocks new opportunities and community progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new tools, unlock unique seeds, and discover delightful decorations to personalize your garden. As you expand your gardening skills, new opportunities open up - from secret garden spots to charming new areas to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf38 A Gentle World, One Task at a Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no deadlines here. No stress. Just calm, heartfelt gameplay that lets you take life one task - and one bloom - at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're planting sunflowers, mowing a neighbor\u2019s lawn, or sweeping leaves off a path, everything you do brings a little more joy to this cozy little world.<br><br>\ud83c\udf3c Cozy Gardener Simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful life. A growing heart. Welcome home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
